#   Compound DAO, Optimism Collective) — not separately resourced since they
#   are not in the article's References section and are covered elsewhere in
#   the site's dedicated DAO articles; folded into this entry's summary only.
# - "Try This" exercise steps (install MetaMask, browse a Layer 2, search a
#   block explorer, find a DAO) — action prompts for the reader, not
#   extractable knowledge-graph content.
